<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices -April 30.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices -April 30.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	    91/92     98/99	UNQ     194/196</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	   97/99    102/104   195/198   210/213</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Singapore bunker quotes were steady to slightly firmer on Wednesday in line with overnight crude gains but talks were thin as many Japanese buyers were away on holidays.</p>
<p>&quot;Enquiries are very thin today and the market is pretty much in a holiday mood for the May Day,&quot; said one trader.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-870-3571)</p>
